From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 23:28:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: freeze extension registry to offline-only

Remove all HTTP fetches in extension_host: fetch_extensions_from_api
returns Vec::new(), install_latest_extension/upgrade_extension/
install_or_upgrade_extension are no-ops, and the tar.gz download
function (install_or_upgrade_extension_at_endpoint) is deleted.

Local extension installation via 'Install Dev Extension' (sideload
from disk) continues to work; the registry browser becomes an empty
list and remote install/upgrade buttons log a warning.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/extension_host/src/extension_host.rs | 216 ++------------------
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 198 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/extension_host/src/extension_host.rs b/crates/extension_host/src/extension_host.rs
index 9c288666af..af9e219f13 100644
--- a/crates/extension_host/src/extension_host.rs
+++ b/crates/extension_host/src/extension_host.rs
@@ -725,40 +725,11 @@ impl ExtensionStore {
 
     fn fetch_extensions_from_api(
         &self,
-        path: &str,
